  - worker.py, config.yaml, accounts_use_ai.json [contains SECRETS]
  - actions/: file_manager.py, response_parser.py, command_runner.py,
    session_manager.py
  - providers/ (11 files): base.py, registry.py, openai_shelby.py,
    use_ai.py, deepseek.py, …
  - static/app.js (~2,708 lines): initWebSocket (~L53), sendMessage
    (~L449), handleWSMessage (~L81), appendStreamChunk (~L581)
• test---results/ : QA archive (00_QA_PLAN.md, T01–T04 results,
