Legacy claimed issues (verify each):
• BUG-01 (claimed S1): Mode Confusion — server.py ~L793-822 +
  response_parser.parse(): chat mode still extracts/renders action cards.
• BUG-02 (claimed S1): No Provider Fallback — _process_ai_chat (~L678):
